<section class="phero"><div class="phero-media"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-crew.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-crew-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-crew.webp 1024w" sizes="100vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><span aria-current="page">Services</span></nav><p class="kicker">What we appraise</p><h1>Insurance Appraisal Services in New Hampshire</h1><p class="lede">Twelve services, one goal: an accurate, defensible valuation of your loss. Start with an estimate audit, bring us in as your appointed appraiser, or ask us to serve as umpire.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line-light" href="/contact-nh-appraiser/">Free claim review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="row-list" data-stagger><a class="row-card rv" href="/nh-appraisal-services/appraisal-clause-representation-nh/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consult-table.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consult-table-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consult-table.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><small>01 · <svg class="ico-sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"/><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"/></svg></small><h2>Policyholder’s Appraiser on the Panel</h2><p>We act as the appraiser you appoint when your policy’s appraisal clause is invoked on a New Hampshire claim.</p></span><svg class="row-go" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/nh-appraisal-services/homeowners-claim-appraisal-nh/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/colonial-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/colonial-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/colonial-home.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><small>02 · <svg class="ico-sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 10.5L12 3l9 7.5V21a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-5v-7H9v7H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1z"/></svg></small><h2>Single-Family Home Claims</h2><p>Capes, colonials, ranches and new builds — independent valuation when the carrier’s house estimate falls short.</p></span><svg class="row-go" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/nh-appraisal-services/nh-commercial-hoa-appraisal/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/condo-building.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/condo-building-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/condo-building.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><small>03 · <svg class="ico-sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M9 6h2M13 6h2M9 10h2M13 10h2M9 14h2M13 14h2M10 22v-4h4v4"/></svg></small><h2>Condo, Association &amp; Business Claims</h2><p>Mill conversions, condo associations, multifamily and main-street storefronts with complex scopes and shared walls.</p></span><svg class="row-go" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/nh-appraisal-services/roof-and-hail-appraisal/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-aerial-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-aerial-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-aerial-damage.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><small>04 · <svg class="ico-sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 16.6A5 5 0 0 0 18 7h-1.3A8 8 0 1 0 4 15.3"/><path d="M8 19v1M8 14v1M16 19v1M16 14v1M12 21v1M12 16v1"/></svg></small><h2>Roof Damage &amp; Hail Disputes</h2><p>Hail, wind and storm roof losses where the carrier priced patches, missed slopes or skipped New Hampshire code items.</p></span><svg class="row-go" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/nh-appraisal-services/wind-microburst-tornado-appraisal/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/storm-collapsed-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-collapsed-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-collapsed-house.webp 1021w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1021" height="681" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><small>05 · <svg class="ico-sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M17.7 7.7A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 19.5 12H2M9.6 4.6A2 2 0 1 1 11 8H2M12.6 19.4A2 2 0 1 0 14 16H2"/></svg></small><h2>Microburst &amp; Windstorm Losses</h2><p>Straight-line winds, microbursts and the occasional tornado — when the carrier’s wind scope stops at the obvious.</p></span><svg class="row-go" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/nh-appraisal-services/tropical-storm-hurricane-appraisal-nh/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/flood-damaged-homes.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/flood-damaged-homes-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/flood-damaged-homes.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><small>06 · <svg class="ico-sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M19 16.9A5 5 0 0 0 18 7h-1.3a8 8 0 1 0-11.7 9"/><path d="M13 11l-4 6h6l-4 6"/></svg></small><h2>Tropical Remnants &amp; Coastal Storms</h2><p>Tropical remnants and nor’easter wind on the Seacoast and inland — with honest talk about what policies cover.</p></span><svg class="row-go" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/nh-appraisal-services/pipe-burst-water-appraisal/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/kitchen-interior.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/kitchen-interior-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/kitchen-interior.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><small>07 · <svg class="ico-sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 22a7 7 0 0 0 7-7c0-2-1-3.9-3-5.5s-3.5-4-4-6.5c-.5 2.5-2 4.9-4 6.5S5 13 5 15a7 7 0 0 0 7 7z"/></svg></small><h2>Frozen Pipe &amp; Leak Claims</h2><p>Frozen pipes, failed boilers and slow leaks in homes and seasonal camps — valued with the hidden damage included.</p></span><svg class="row-go" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/nh-appraisal-services/fire-smoke-soot-appraisal/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/fire-damaged-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/fire-damaged-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/fire-damaged-house.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><small>08 · <svg class="ico-sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8.5 14.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 11 12c0-1.4-.5-2-1-3-1.1-2.1-.2-4 2-6 .5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5 2 1.6 3 3.5 3 5.5a7 7 0 1 1-14 0c0-1.2.4-2.3 1-3.4.4 1.4 1.4 2.4 2.5 2.4z"/></svg></small><h2>Chimney, Fire &amp; Smoke Losses</h2><p>Chimney fires, woodstove incidents, kitchen fires and full losses — with smoke and soot scope valued properly.</p></span><svg class="row-go" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/nh-appraisal-services/ice-dam-roof-snow-appraisal/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/icicles-eaves.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/icicles-eaves-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/icicles-eaves.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><small>09 · <svg class="ico-sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 2v20M4.9 4.9l14.2 14.2M2 12h20M4.9 19.1L19.1 4.9M9 3l3 3 3-3M9 21l3-3 3 3M3 9l3 3-3 3M21 9l-3 3 3 3"/></svg></small><h2>Ice Dams &amp; Heavy Roof Snow</h2><p>Ice dam leaks, roof snow load and collapse claims — New Hampshire’s signature winter losses, valued in full.</p></span><svg class="row-go" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/nh-appraisal-services/falling-tree-claim-appraisal/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/ice-storm-car.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/ice-storm-car-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/ice-storm-car.webp 940w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="940" height="627" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><small>10 · <svg class="ico-sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 22v-5M7 17h10l-3-4h2l-4-5h1.5L12 3 8.5 8H10l-4 5h2z"/></svg></small><h2>Trees Down on the Property</h2><p>Pines through the roof, oaks across the garage — valued with structural damage, removal and cleanup included.</p></span><svg class="row-go" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/nh-appraisal-services/insurer-estimate-audit/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-papers.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-papers-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-papers.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><small>11 · <svg class="ico-sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h5"/></svg></small><h2>Line-by-Line Estimate Audit</h2><p>A line-by-line review of the carrier’s estimate so you know what is missing before you sign or invoke appraisal.</p></span><svg class="row-go" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/nh-appraisal-services/appraisal-umpire-nh/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consult-laptop.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consult-laptop-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consult-laptop.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><small>12 · <svg class="ico-sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3v18M7 21h10M5 7h14M5 7l-3 7a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 6 0zM19 7l-3 7a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 6 0z"/></svg></small><h2>Neutral Umpire Appointments</h2><p>Neutral umpire services for New Hampshire appraisal panels when the two appraisers can’t reach agreement.</p></span><svg class="row-go" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec sec-tint"><div class="wrap split split-top"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker">Not sure where to start?</p><h2>Most files begin with an estimate audit</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the insurer’s estimate falls short and what that difference is worth. An audit answers that quickly, and plenty of disputes close at that stage with a documented supplement.</p><a class="btn btn-navy" href="/nh-appraisal-services/insurer-estimate-audit/">About estimate audits <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for one part of the process?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Many owners start with an estimate audit and decide later whether to demand appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle commercial and association claims?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes — condominium associations, multifamily buildings, mill conversions, retail, offices and churches, as well as single-family homes.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is it only winter claims?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>No. We also work on wind, hail, tree, water, fire and tropical-storm losses.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="band"><div class="wrap band-in rv"><div><h2>Does the insurer’s number actually cover the work?</h2><p>Send us the insurer’s estimate. We’ll read it line by line and tell you what we see.</p></div><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line-light" href="/contact-nh-appraiser/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
